4346,sample_en.pdf,sample_en.pdf-chunk-002,pdf,,2,409,/home/jose/repositories/kernel-boyacense/corpus_adl/data/sample_en.pdf,"With this example, in which the crucial functional
group can be easily identiﬁed, we understand that it is possible to automatically and
