peak m= 437.13 (s=1.19), corresponding to the 
blue absorption of chlorophyll; b) in the interval 
600-700 nm, there were other two relevant absorption 
peaks at the averaged position m = 632.80 (s = 1.21) 
due to water absorption which is in good agreement 
with peaks found by Pegau and Zaneveld (1993) 
